  "details": "I have been playing VRChat for a long time and have not had this issue before now. \n\nI am able to get to my home world just fine with no complications. When I try to join any other world, It will load the world, than my screen will go black, 30 seconds will pass, the error sound will play, it will briefly show that its logging me in than the cycle repeats until I exit the game\n\nI have tried clearing the game cache, validating the cache, re-installing and restarting my computer. sometimes it will work correctly for a little bit, but then it will go back to the way it was.\n\nPlease help!",
